#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "儲存後會將 GPU 資料查詢新增至裝置，並關閉 Cacti 的自動重新索引功能：外掛程式會在每次 GPU 變更後自動重新索引。請先設定裝置的 SNMP 代理程式；請參閱 docs/node-setup.md。"

#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Save"
msgstr "儲存"

#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Absent GPUs"
msgstr "缺失的 GPU"

#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "缺失的 GPU 仍會保留為資料查詢的索引，因此其圖表與 RRD 檔案仍會維持關聯並顯示斷層。將其從資料查詢中移除可停止此行為：在下次重新索引時，Cacti 將不再列出該 GPU，其圖表將停止更新且資料來源會顯示為孤立狀態，而其 RRD 檔案與圖表會保留直到您手動刪除為止。GPU 記錄本身會保留，若日後再次回報該 GPU，它會重新回到資料查詢中。"

#: lib/NodesPage.php
